# Events task — skill + MCP + verifier gate (enforced)

> **Orchestrator:** [`mdeai-workflow.mdc`](./mdeai-workflow.mdc) class **U/S** for Events paths.

**Canonical order + per-task packs:** [`docs/events/todo.md`](../../../docs/events/todo.md) (symlink: `tasks/events/todo.md`)  
**Skills index:** [`index-skills.md`](../../../index-skills.md) § Events Platform  
**Orchestrator:** [`mdeai-done-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-done-gate.mdc)

## Hard rules

1. **Before any Events implementation** — run pre-verify ([`mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc`](./mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc)): load the task's **≤5 skills** + **MCP probes** from `todo.md` § Per-task verify pack; score readiness; **no code if &lt; 70 or 🔴 blocker**.
2. **Before Linear Done / claiming 100% correct** — run **`task-verifier`** forensic pass on disk + runtime; append evidence; update [`changelog.md`](../../../tasks/events/changelog.md).
3. **Load cap** — max **5 skills** per task; read each `SKILL.md` under `.claude/skills/` (do not guess APIs).
4. **MCP before external APIs** — Supabase schema/RLS, CopilotKit, Gemini models, Maps field masks — per task row in `todo.md`.

## Required workflow (every SAN row in todo.md)

```text
Pick task from todo.md (dependency order)
  → Linear MCP get_issue (+ includeRelations)
  → Load ≤5 skills from Per-task verify pack
  → Run MCP probes from pack
  → task-verifier pre-impl (readiness ≥ 70, no 🔴)
  → Update todo.md row (Readiness, Success rate, Failure points)
  → GO only → implement
  → testing + browser + cr/cubic + evidence
  → task-verifier post-ship (100% AC on disk)
  → changelog row → Linear In Review → Done (user OK)
```

## Pre-impl output (mandatory in chat or Linear comment)

```markdown
## Pre-verify — SAN-### · SPEC-ID — title
Skills loaded: (≤5, from todo pack)
MCP probes: (list + pass/fail)
Readiness: NN/100 · Success rate (est.): NN%
Verdict: GO | HOLD
```

## Done output (mandatory before Linear Done)

```markdown
## task-verifier — SAN-### · SPEC-ID — title
AC checklist: N/N verified on disk + runtime
Evidence: tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-RESULTS.md
Grade / % correct: (changelog)
Verdict: SHIP | HOLD — list any unverified AC
```

**Never** flip Done from status fields, memory, or Linear alone.

